# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Networkwalks B083 — Mediroza General Hospital Penetration Testing
# Repository hygiene, client-data protection and secret-exclusion rules.
#
# POLICY SUMMARY
#   This repository is PUBLIC. It must never contain client-sensitive data.
#   Unredacted evidence is stored OFF-REPOSITORY in an access-controlled store.
#   If you are unsure whether a file belongs here: it does not.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Credentials, keys and tokens — NEVER COMMIT
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
*.asc
*.gpg
*.ppk
id_rsa*
id_ed25519*
id_ecdsa*
id_dsa*
.netrc
.pgpass
.my.cnf
.aws/
.azure/
.gcloud/
.kube/
kubeconfig
*.kubeconfig

# Cloud / CI provider credentials
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
.terraform/
terraform.tfstate
terraform.tfstate.*

# Session material captured during testing
cookies.txt
*cookies*.txt
*cookies*.json
*session*.json
*session*.txt
burp*.xml
*.har
zap-session*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Raw and unredacted client evidence — NEVER COMMIT
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Screenshots and captures are committed ONLY after manual review and redaction.
*_RAW.*
*_UNREDACTED.*
*_ORIGINAL.*
raw-evidence/
unsanitized/
originals/
capture/
captures/
*_sensitive.*
*nda*

# Real client documents (patient records, payroll, shareholder material)
*.pdf
*.doc
*.docx
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.ppt
*.pptx
!docs/**/*.md
medical/
patient/
patients/
clinical/
records/
payroll/
salary/
salaries/
shareholder/
shareholders/
hr-export*

# Database / dump exports
*.sql
*.dump
*.bak
*.mdb
*.accdb
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 3. Scanned and reconnaissance output — NEVER COMMIT
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
nmap*.xml
nmap*.nmap
nmap*.txt
nikto*
dirbuster*/
gobuster*/
ffuf*/
feroxbuster*/
wfuzz*
sqlmap*
nikto/
 amass*.json
subfinder*.txt
masscan*
zgrab*
tlsscan*
responder*.log
hashcat*
john/
hydra*
cewl*

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 4. Tool state, caches and interpreter artefacts
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.venv/
venv/
env/
ENV/
.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.coverage
.coverage.*
htmlcov/
coverage.xml
*.log

# Editor / OS noise
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
*.lnk

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 5. Repository QA output
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
nw-sanitizer-out/
sanitized-out/
*sanitizer-report.json
repo-check-report.json
.tmp/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 6. Templates and generated artefacts that must be regenerated, not hand-edited
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# (Intentionally NOT ignored: templates/ is committed so contributors can use them.)

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 7. Allow-list for evidence placeholders
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# NOTE: This repository intentionally contains NO binary evidence files.
# Placeholder directories are preserved via .gitkeep files, which are
# explicitly NOT ignored. Once sanitized evidence is approved for
# publication, add the extension to the allow-list section of
# evidence/README.md rather than weakening the rules above.
!.gitkeep
